  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Welcome to the bunker, there are a few things you might need to know in
    order to have the smoothest possible experience here. There are creatures who
    roam these lands. Hostile creatures. All attempts made to kill said creatures
    have proven useless, however they like all things feel pain.


    Each day,
    you must go out and scavenge the local enviroment, collecting resources and dropping
    them into the storage crate outside. When alerted you MUST return to the bunker
    before nightfall otherwise you will not survive.


    Your bunker is equipped
    with defences in order to dissuade those creatures from breaking into the bunker
    and taking you away. Right know there is only the turrets but more can be aquired
    through the upgrade terminal. The turrets however can only be active on one side
    at a time, thus the bunker is equipped with rotate levers that will allow you
    to change the side the turrets are targetting.


    The technology in the bunker
    is also very volatile. If gas starts leaking the emergency lights will turn on
    and you will need to fix the leak.


    Now good luck and don''t let the creatures
    bite! : )'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
